==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**28,000 grants +1 Rare Ticket.
**28,100 grants +5 Super Rare Catseyes.
**28,200 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
*Added the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]] content from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] to international versions.
*Raised [[Burgle Boss Cat (Retired) (Special Cat)|Burgle Boss Cat (Retired)]]'s + level cap from +0 to +5.
*Raised [[Medal King (Special Cat)|Medal King]]'s + level cap from +20 to +25.
*Raised [[Lieutenant Cat (Special Cat)|Lieutenant Cat]]'s + level cap from +5 to +10.
*Added 1 new ability: [[Immune to Drain]].
**Added Immune to Drain to [[Saber the Cat (Special Cat)|Saber Alter Cat]].
*Added device vibration setting, causing vibration whenever an enemy or base is hit. Hitting a [[Barrier]] or [[Shield]] will not cause vibration.
*Altered English descriptions for all purchasable Special Cats (except [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]]), [[Tricycle Cat (Special Cat)|Tricycle Cat]], [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]], all [[:Category:Crazed Cats|Crazed Cats]], [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Lesser Demon Cat]], [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]], [[Mighty Drednot (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Drednot]], [[Gilgamesh (Uber Rare Cat)|Gilgamesh]] and Saber Alter Cat.
*Renamed Ninja Frog Cat to Frog Ninja Cat, Miss MONEKO to Miss Moneko and Superstar MONEKO to Superstar Moneko.
*Added ", type" to the Evolved Form names of [[First-Love Myrcia (Uber Rare Cat)|First Love Myrcia]], [[Night Beach Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Night Beach Lilin]], [[Reindeer Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Reindeer Terun]], [[Music Fest Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Music Fest Thundia]] and [[Seaside Pegasa (Uber Rare Cat)|Seaside Pegasa]].

==Trivia==
*Vibration was first introduced in the Nintendo Switch port of the game, [[The Battle Cats Unite!]]. However, Unite! only has vibration when a boss shockwave occurs or when an enemy is sent flying and landing unto the screen. Furthermore, the gap between the release of the Switch port and this addition is 2,804 days.
